ent [hidden]{display:none!important}\n@media(max-width:760px){\n .xl-lesson>header{margin:10px 10px 0;padding:22px 20px 16px;border-radius:19px}.xl-lesson>main{margin:14px 10px 60px;padding:0}\n .xl-lesson>header nav{gap:6px}.xl-lesson>header nav button{font-size:16px;padding:10px}\n .xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide,.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-lesson .reading-block{padding:20px 18px;border-radius:17px}\n .xl-opening h2{font-size:23px}.xl-reading-path{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xl-products{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n .xl-lesson .charts,.xl-lesson .maps,.xl-lesson .split,.xl-lesson .workspace,.xl-lesson .two-columns,.xl-lesson .plot-grid,.xl-lesson .analysis{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important;gap:18px}\n .xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid,.xl-lesson .condition-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n .xl-lesson .metric,.xl-lesson .metrics,.xl-lesson .strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-wrap:wrap}\n .xl-step-heading{display:block}.xl-step-heading h3{margin-top:8px}.xl-step-nav{gap:6px}.xl-step-nav button{font-size:15px;padding:9px 11px}\n .xl-lesson .charts figure{padding:7px}.xl-lesson .chart,.xl-lesson .plot,.xl-lesson .chart-shell,.xl-lesson .svg-frame{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n .xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{max-height:240px}.xl-method .case-flow-overview{padding:10px;overflow:auto}.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{min-width:650px}\n .xl-diagram svg{min-width:680px;max-height:none}.xl-data-plot>svg,.xl-data-plot>canvas{min-width:760px;max-width:none!important;width:760px!important;height:auto}\n .xl-diagram-hint{display:block;position:sticky;left:0;font-size:14px;color:#867476;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0 2px}\n .xl-lesson .action-row,.xl-lesson .actions,.xl-lesson .bottom-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-lesson .view-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}\n}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xl-lesson *,.xl-parent *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style><div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>将坐标与C1、C2、C3三项浓度连起来，先认清一条记录。</p><p>地球化学勘察把采样位置与化学测量放到一起：在一组地表点位采集土壤气，测量甲烷 C1、乙烷 C2、丙烷 C3 等组分。点位是空间位置，组分是这个位置的观测；两者必须同时保留，才能判断高值是否形成可追查的区域。</p><p>甲烷可以有不同来源，土壤条件与生物活动也会改变近地表浓度。因此，本例的问题是“哪里偏离了当地背景”，下一步才是回查样品、现场条件与其他资料。横轴和纵轴以 km 表示；浓度统一以ppm表示，联合距离先按背景尺度比较各组分。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"带坐标与三组分的两条教学采样记录\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#f7faf8\" rx=\"12\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><path d=\"M70 45v150h590\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#829e91\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"32\">北向 / km ↑</text><text x=\"510\" y=\"244\">东向 / km →</text><text x=\"55\" y=\"220\">0</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"220\">2</text><text x=\"445\" y=\"220\">6</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"220\">9</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"118\">4</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"55\">7</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"115\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#277c68\"/><circle cx=\"460\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#a77c48\"/><path d=\"M200 115l40 32m220-92l30 43\" stroke=\"#94ad9d\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"160\">A (2,4)：C1=3.0 / C2=0.4 / C3=0.1 ppm</text><text x=\"305\" y=\"126\">B (6,7)：C1=4.0 / C2=0.7 / C3=0.3 ppm</text></g></svg></figure><p class=\"note\">图中两点用于练习坐标与组分记录；每点三项浓度均需保留。</p></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "METHOD",
          "title": "背景怎样表达多组分的联合关系",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>沿背景椭圆长轴和横穿椭圆比较，理解联合距离为何考虑共同变化。</p><p>背景点也有波动。假如 C1 与 C2 随同一种背景因素一起上升，沿着这条关系变化未必异常；相反，一个绝对数值不算很高、却明显偏离通常比例的点也值得关注。统计背景需要在待查区域之外的独立标定点上建立。</p><p>本例从 260 个背景样本学习三个组分的均值和协方差，计算 Mahalanobis 距离。协方差同时描述各指标的尺度和共同变化方向，因此把“沿背景变化”和“横穿背景关系”分开处理。单指标基线只看 C1 高于背景均值几个标准差。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C1与C2的相关背景和偏离点\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f7f5\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><path d=\"M65 160V30m0 130h610\" stroke=\"#8a9c93\" fill=\"none\"/><ellipse cx=\"295\" cy=\"110\" rx=\"150\" ry=\"25\" transform=\"rotate(-14 295 110)\" fill=\"#bad7ca\" fill-opacity=\".7\"/><path d=\"M145 147l310-79\" stroke=\"#318173\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"43\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#bd7147\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"38\">C2 / ppm</text><text x=\"566\" y=\"192\">C1 / ppm →</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"48\">偏离联合背景</text><text x=\"194\" y=\"165\">长轴方向：常见共同变化</text></g></svg><p class=\"note\">椭圆为解释协方差的概念示意；运行时点位图来自实际生成数组。</p></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "READING",
          "title": "把异常带回空间位置，决定哪里复核",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>地图负责定位，交会图负责解释关系；C3也参与计算。</p><p>距离超过阈值的点会在地图上显示，先比较单点高值与成片分布。点击一个点，先读其 C1–C3 数值，再看联合距离与单指标得分是否一致。阈值提高会减少候选，也可能漏掉边缘点；调节甲烷背景波动，能观察只依赖 C1 的规则为何更不稳定。</p><p>演示使用具有固定空间异常区的教学数据，训练点与测试点独立生成。模型只读取三项浓度；地图坐标用于定位，异常区标记只在预测后计算召回、误报与 F1。图中“参考异常”勾选开关仅控制评价层显示。专业阅读：<a href=\"https://pubs.usgs.gov/wri/1994/4006/report.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USGS 近地表气体组分研究</a>。</p><p class=\"note\">专业判断应回到采样与来源核查。</p></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "READ_AND_TEST",
          "title": "从采样记录到联合异常：沿着同一编号读两幅图",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p>图中A、B用于说明一条采样记录如何保留坐标与组分。现场每个采样点应保留坐标、采样条件和C1–C3三项浓度；本演示ppm表示体积混合比的教学设定。上方空间图用于定位，下方C1–C2交会图用于看组分关系，同一个选中点在交会图中放大。C3虽未画在二维图上，仍参与三维联合距离；所以二维视觉上接近的点也可能得到不同分数。</p><p><b>固定数据种子，验证阈值的作用：</b>运行后点选一个绿点，记下浓度和联合距离；将联合阈值由3.3升至6再运行。浓度和距离不变，候选数只能减少或不变，召回可能下降。再恢复默认，提高甲烷背景波动：这次训练背景与测试背景都会重新按同一设置生成，背景协方差也改变，对照背景椭圆的形状与测试分布，观察二者如何一同变化。Mahalanobis距离衡量偏离背景的程度；解释热成因、生物气或污染来源，还要回查采样与地质化学资料。</p></div>"
        }
      ],
      "lessonOpening": "<div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">认识问题 · 再看方法</span><h2>异常是偏离当地多组分背景的程度；甲烷单点升高还需要回到组分与位置一起解释。</h2><p>从一个土壤气采样点出发，把专业含义、图中位置和计算结果连起来。</p><div class=\"xl-reading-path\"><a href=\"#xl-chapter-0\" data-xl-chapter=\"0\"><span>01</span>先问采到了什么，再看数值有多高</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-1\" data-xl-chapter=\"1\"><span>02</span>背景怎样表达多组分的联合关系</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-2\" data-xl-chapter=\"2\"><span>03</span>把异常带回空间位置，决定哪里复核</a></div></div>"
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "从观测到可核查的解释",
      "lead": [
        "地表土壤气中的甲烷升高，怎样结合背景与组分理解？先认识背景、组分和采样位置，再用背景样本学习多指标的正常关系。"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "建立独立背景",
          "role": "资料",
          "do": "输入：260个无目标异常背景点，保留C1–C3浓度。 动作：计算均值与协方差，甲烷背景波动与当前设置一致。",
          "effect": "背景均值、协方差逆矩阵与单指标标准差。",
          "trap": "从目标区域外选背景标定点，浓度统一单位。"
        },
        {
          "name": "计算联合距离",
          "role": "方法",
          "do": "输入：独立180个测试点，只向评分函数传浓度向量。 动作：按协方差归一化三组分的偏离，同时计算C1标准分数。",
          "effect": "每个点的联合距离和单指标得分。",
          "trap": "模型读取C1—C3浓度，地图坐标用于定位采样点。"
        },
        {
          "name": "阈值筛选并定位",
          "role": "计算",
          "do": "输入：当前联合阈值和固定C1>2标准差基线。 动作：分别筛选候选，在同一地图叠加并允许点选。",
          "effect": "候选点清单、原始组分与模型依据。",
          "trap": "联合距离表示偏离背景的程度，再对照采样条件解释来源。"
        },
        {
          "name": "独立参考核对",
          "role": "解释",
          "do": "输入：两种方法已固定的预测与教学参考。 动作：计算TP、FP、FN及F1、召回和误报率。",
          "effect": "相同180点分母下的比较与可导出结果。",
          "trap": "空预测集的精确率显示为不适用，保留实际候选数。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "逐步说明与产物",
        "html": "<style>/* Applied only to the56 expansion lessons; data-category colors are preserved. */\n.xl-lesson,.xl-parent{--xl-red:#b8242a;--xl-paper:#f7f4ef;--xl-ink:#292d34;--xl-muted:#66717d;--xl-line:#e6dfd7;color:var(--xl-ink);font-size:18px;line-height:1.85}\nbody.xl-lesson{margin:0;background:var(--xl-paper);font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",system-ui,sans-serif}\n.xl-lesson>header{max-width:1180px;margin:28px auto 0;padding:32px 38px 20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #3b282608}\n.xl-lesson>header h1{color:#292d34;font-size:clamp(25px,2.6vw,36px);line-height:1.5;max-width:1000px;margin:12px 0}\n.xl-lesson>main{max-width:1180px;margin:24px auto 70px;padding:0 0 25px;min-width:0}\n.xl-lesson>header nav{position:static;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;padding:14px 0 0;margin:14px 0 0}\n.xl-lesson>nav{max-width:1180px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 10px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:transparent;border:0;position:static}\n.xl-lesson>nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:var(--xl-red);border-color:var(--xl-red);color:white}\n.xl-lesson>header nav button,.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent button{font:inherit;line-height:1.5;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer}\n.xl-lesson button,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button,.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:#fff;color:#4d4343;border:1px solid #ddd5d0;border-radius:13px;padding:10px 17px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}\n.xl-lesson button:hover,.xl-parent .xl-step-nav button:hover{border-color:var(--xl-red);background:#fff8f5}\n.xl-lesson button.primary,.xl-lesson button.active,.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-pressed=\"true\"],.xl-lesson header nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-step-nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"],.xl-parent .xl-next button{background:var(--xl-red);color:white;border-color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-lesson button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}\n.xl-lesson :focus-visible,.xl-parent :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b8242a88;outline-offset:4px}\n.xl-lesson input,.xl-lesson select,.xl-lesson textarea{font:inherit;min-width:0;max-width:100%;accent-color:var(--xl-red);border-radius:9px}\n.xl-lesson input[type=range]{width:100%}.xl-lesson label{font-size:17px;color:#45434a}\n.xl-lesson p{max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.xl-lesson .intro,.xl-lesson .note,.xl-lesson .small,.xl-lesson .data-note,.xl-lesson .legend,.xl-lesson figcaption,.xl-parent figcaption,.xl-parent .note{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#64707a}\n.xl-lesson .source-badge,.xl-kicker{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--xl-red);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}\n.xl-lesson .brand,.xl-lesson .eyebrow,.xl-lesson .tag,.xl-lesson .kicker,.xl-lesson output,.xl-lesson>header a{color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-parent #tabs .tab.on{background:var(--xl-red);border-color:var(--xl-red);color:#fff}\n.xl-lesson h2,.xl-parent .xl-opening h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.55;color:#292d34;margin:12px 0 20px}\n.xl-lesson h3{font-size:21px;color:#333842;line-height:1.55}\n.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .reading-block,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 22px #382b2105;padding:26px 30px;margin:20px 0}\n.xl-opening{padding:28px 32px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff 60%,#fff3ed)}\n.xl-opening h2{max-width:960px;font-size:27px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.65}\n.xl-opening>p{margin-bottom:0;color:var(--xl-muted)}\n.xl-reading-path{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:24px 0 2px}\n.xl-reading-path a{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ece3dd;border-radius:14px;color:#4d4343;text-decoration:none;line-height:1.6;font-size:16px}\n.xl-reading-path a span{font-size:13px;color:var(--xl-red);font-weight:750}\n.xl-read{padding:13px 17px;border-left:3px solid var(--xl-red);background:#fbf6f1;color:#5d4f49;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0}\n.xl-read b{display:block;color:var(--xl-red);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:4px}\n.xl-chapter{scroll-margin-top:22px}\n.xl-knowledge>p{margin:20px 0}.xl-knowledge>p.xl-read{margin:0 0 22px}\n.xl-knowledge figure{margin:24px 0}.xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:900px;max-height:280px;height:auto;margin:18px auto}\n.xl-knowledge img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px}\n.xl-diagram,.xl-data-plot{max-width:100%;min-width:0;overflow:auto}.xl-diagram-hint{display:none}\n.xl-method>.case-flow-overview,.xl-parent .case-flow-overview{margin:20px 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);border-radius:20px;padding:20px;box-shadow:none}\n.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{max-height:300px;width:100%;height:auto}\n.xl-step-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:22px 0 14px}\n.xl-step-nav button{font-size:16px;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px}\n.xl-step-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px}.xl-step-heading h3{margin:0;font-size:24px}\n.xl-action-copy>b,.xl-products b{font-size:14px;color:var(--xl-red)}.xl-action-copy p{margin:7px 0 24px}\n.xl-products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--xl-line);padding-top:18px;margin-top:22px}\n.xl-products p{font-size:17px;margin:7px 0}.xl-next{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin:22px 0}\n.xl-lab-guide{border-top:3px solid var(--xl-red);padding:22px 28px}\n.xl-lab-guide h2{margin:4px 0 10px;font-size:23px}.xl-lab-guide>p{margin:8px 0 16px;color:#645f61;font-size:17px}\n.xl-task-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-task-actions button{font-size:16px}\n.xl-task-actions button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#fbebeb;border-color:#c27b7e;color:#9c2026}\n.xl-task-look{padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--xl-line);margin-top:18px!important;font-size:17px;color:#3d4650!important;min-height:1.8em}\n.xl-update{font-size:14px;color:#7d6c67;display:block;margin-top:10px}\n.xl-lesson #status{font-size:16px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff7f2;border:1px solid #edd8ce;color:#754b45;padding:12px 16px}\n.xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid{gap:18px}\n.xl-lesson .toolbar{border-radius:18px;background:#fff9f5;border:1px solid var(--xl-line);padding:18px}\n.xl-lesson .charts{gap:24px}.xl-lesson .charts figure{min-width:0;border:1px solid #eee8e2;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;margin:0}\n.xl-lesson .charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:100%}\n.xl-lesson .metric strong,.xl-lesson .metrics strong{color:#a52a31}.xl-lesson .metric>div{border-radius:13px;background:#faf6f1;border:1px solid #e8ded5;color:#514b4b}\n.xl-lesson table{font-size:16px}.xl-lesson th{background:#f5eee8;color:#54474a}.xl-lesson td,.xl-lesson th{padding:11px 13px;border-color:#e9e2da}\n.xl-lesson a{color:#a32c34}.xl-lesson .scroll,.xl-lesson .table-wrap,.xl-lesson .table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n.xl-fold{margin:18px 0;background:#fcfaf7;border:1px solid #e7ded7;border-radius:15px;padding:14px 18px}\n.xl-fold>summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;color:#665658;line-height:1.8}.xl-fold[open]>summary{margin-bottom:18px}\n.xl-fold>*:not(summary){box-shadow:none}.xl-save{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:20px 0;margin-top:20px}\n.xl-save button{font-size:15px;color:#7a6264;background:transparent;padding:8px 13px;min-height:38px}\n.xl-lesson .learning-task,.xl-lesson #lab>.reading-block:first-child{display:none}\n.xl-parent .sr-eyebrow,.xl-parent .sr-toc button[aria-current=\"true\"]{color:var(--xl-red)}\n.xl-parent .sr-demo-bar{background:#fff9f5;border-color:#e5d6cd}.xl-parent .sr-demo-bar strong{color:#332f36}\n.xl-parent .sr-lede,.xl-parent .sr-toc{background:#fff9f5;border-color:#e5d6cd}\n.xl-lesson [hidden],.xl-parent [hidden]{display:none!important}\n@media(max-width:760px){\n .xl-lesson>header{margin:10px 10px 0;padding:22px 20px 16px;border-radius:19px}.xl-lesson>main{margin:14px 10px 60px;padding:0}\n .xl-lesson>header nav{gap:6px}.xl-lesson>header nav button{font-size:16px;padding:10px}\n .xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide,.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-lesson .reading-block{padding:20px 18px;border-radius:17px}\n .xl-opening h2{font-size:23px}.xl-reading-path{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xl-products{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n .xl-lesson .charts,.xl-lesson .maps,.xl-lesson .split,.xl-lesson .workspace,.xl-lesson .two-columns,.xl-lesson .plot-grid,.xl-lesson .analysis{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important;gap:18px}\n .xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid,.xl-lesson .condition-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n .xl-lesson .metric,.xl-lesson .metrics,.xl-lesson .strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-wrap:wrap}\n .xl-step-heading{display:block}.xl-step-heading h3{margin-top:8px}.xl-step-nav{gap:6px}.xl-step-nav button{font-size:15px;padding:9px 11px}\n .xl-lesson .charts figure{padding:7px}.xl-lesson .chart,.xl-lesson .plot,.xl-lesson .chart-shell,.xl-lesson .svg-frame{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n .xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{max-height:240px}.xl-method .case-flow-overview{padding:10px;overflow:auto}.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{min-width:650px}\n .xl-diagram svg{min-width:680px;max-height:none}.xl-data-plot>svg,.xl-data-plot>canvas{min-width:760px;max-width:none!important;width:760px!important;height:auto}\n .xl-diagram-hint{display:block;position:sticky;left:0;font-size:14px;color:#867476;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0 2px}\n .xl-lesson .action-row,.xl-lesson .actions,.xl-lesson .bottom-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-lesson .view-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}\n}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xl-lesson *,.xl-parent *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style><div class=\"xl-method\"><div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">沿着资料走一遍</span><h2>从观测到可核查的解释</h2><p>图中的分支对应方法和基线；下面每一步都说明输入、动作与产物，进入演示后可改变条件查看实际数值。</p></div><figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"g2\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"油气地球化学异常：从单点高值到联合背景偏离\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-g2\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 3L0 6Z\" fill=\"#78958b\"/></marker></defs>\n <path d=\"M210 65H230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><path d=\"M420 65H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><path d=\"M630 65H670\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><path d=\"M800 65H880\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">可继续</text><path d=\"M735 110V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><text x=\"775\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">需核查</text><path d=\"M325 95V170H440\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同一观测</text><path d=\"M860 170H870V120H975V95\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><text x=\"927\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">确认后</text><path d=\"M975 95V140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><path d=\"M535 195V222H975V195\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#78958b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"  marker-end=\"url(#cf-g2)\"/><text x=\"750\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-edge\">同条件对照</text>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"0\" data-flow-node=\"input\" transform=\"translate(20 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eef2ed\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">背景标定点</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">独立背景浓度</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"prepare\" transform=\"translate(230 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">学习背景关系</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">均值与协方差</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">联合距离筛选</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">三组分偏离得分</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">C1标准分数</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">同点位单指标</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"3\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">资料与结果需要复核？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">核查采样来源</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">点选浓度与位置</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">异常候选点表</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">坐标与方法依据</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立参考评价</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">召回与误报分母</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"xl-step-nav\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"方法步骤\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-step=\"0\">01 建立独立背景</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-step=\"1\">02 计算联合距离</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-step=\"2\">03 阈值筛选并定位</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-3\" data-xl-step=\"3\">04 独立参考核对</button></div><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-panel=\"0\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">01 / 4</span><h3>建立独立背景</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>输入：260个无目标异常背景点，保留C1–C3浓度。 动作：计算均值与协方差，甲烷背景波动与当前设置一致。</p></div><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"建立独立背景\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f7f5\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee6\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"87\">260个无目标异常背</text><path d=\"M240 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eaf4\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"87\">计算均值与协方差，甲</text><path d=\"M470 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f2e6cc\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"87\">背景均值、协方差逆矩</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"168\">建立独立背景</text></g></svg></figure><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>背景均值、协方差逆矩阵与单指标标准差。</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>从目标区域外选背景标定点，浓度统一单位。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-panel=\"1\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">02 / 4</span><h3>计算联合距离</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>输入：独立180个测试点，只向评分函数传浓度向量。 动作：按协方差归一化三组分的偏离，同时计算C1标准分数。</p></div><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"计算联合距离\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f7f5\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee6\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"87\">独立180个测试点，</text><path d=\"M240 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eaf4\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"87\">按协方差归一化三组分</text><path d=\"M470 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f2e6cc\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"87\">每个点的联合距离和单</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"168\">计算联合距离</text></g></svg></figure><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>每个点的联合距离和单指标得分。</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>模型读取C1—C3浓度，地图坐标用于定位采样点。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-panel=\"2\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">03 / 4</span><h3>阈值筛选并定位</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>输入：当前联合阈值和固定C1>2标准差基线。 动作：分别筛选候选，在同一地图叠加并允许点选。</p></div><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"阈值筛选并定位\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f7f5\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee6\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"87\">当前联合阈值和固定C</text><path d=\"M240 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eaf4\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"87\">分别筛选候选，在同一</text><path d=\"M470 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f2e6cc\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"87\">候选点清单、原始组分</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"168\">阈值筛选并定位</text></g></svg></figure><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>候选点清单、原始组分与模型依据。</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>联合距离表示偏离背景的程度，再对照采样条件解释来源。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-3\" data-xl-panel=\"3\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">04 / 4</span><h3>独立参考核对</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>输入：两种方法已固定的预测与教学参考。 动作：计算TP、FP、FN及F1、召回和误报率。</p></div><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"独立参考核对\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f4f7f5\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#23453f\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dceee6\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"87\">两种方法已固定的预测</text><path d=\"M240 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eaf4\"/><text x=\"272\" y=\"87\">计算TP、FP、FN</text><path d=\"M470 80h18l-5-4m5 4l-5 4\" stroke=\"#718c81\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"42\" width=\"208\" height=\"76\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f2e6cc\"/><text x=\"502\" y=\"87\">相同180点分母下的</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"168\">独立参考核对</text></g></svg></figure><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>相同180点分母下的比较与可导出结果。</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>空预测集的精确率显示为不适用，保留实际候选数。</p></div></div></article><div class=\"xl-next\"><button type=\"button\" data-xl-tab=\"lab\">用当前数据检验这条流程 →</button></div></div>"
      },
      "lessonHTML": "<div class=\"xl-method\"><div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">沿着资料走一遍</span><h2>从观测到可核查的解释</h2><p>图中的分支对应方法和基线；下面每一步都说明输入、动作与产物，进入演示后可改变条件查看实际数值。</p></div><figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"g2\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"油气地球化学异常：从单点高值到联合背景偏离\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-g2\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0